  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through JUST WORLD in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JUST WORLD will mobilise youth through peacemaker groups and trainings. Using the acquired knowledge &amp; skills, youth will participate in the formulation and implementation of policies. Emphasis will be put on implementation of the South Sudan&#x2019;s Youth policy and the Revitalised agreement on the Resolution of the Conflict (R-ARCSS) as well as National Action Plan on Women, Peace and Security. The participants in these peacemaker groups will be inclusive of young women, youth with disabilities as well as IDPs.</narrative>
  </description>
